884
00:44:06,120 --> 00:44:11,560
We had a small delay of about one week, but overall we stayed close to the timeline.

885
00:44:11,560 --> 00:44:13,680
That's quite good for a technical project.

886
00:44:13,680 --> 00:44:16,220
Yes, we were satisfied with the progress.

887
00:44:16,220 --> 00:44:18,220
